comment.narrative:
National Large-Scale Assessment (NLSA)&nbsp;includes assessment for grades 4, 9, and 12 and&nbsp;International Large-Scale Assessment (ILSA) includes Programme for International Student Assessment (PISA).&nbsp;


 Grade 4 assessment is administered for math, Romanian, and mother tongue if different from Romanian, in May every year. The results have been disseminated from 2013-221 and are expected for 2022.
 Grade 9 national assessment is administered for math, Romanian, mother tongue if different from Romanian and Romanian and International History in May to June&nbsp;every year. The results are disseminated from 2013 to 2019.
 Grade 12 national assessment (Baccalaureate) is administered on the language of instruction, mother tongue, Romanian if different from the mother tongue, foreign language, main subject, and an additional subject in June&nbsp;each year. Data are publicly disseminated from 2013 to 2019 (https://ance.gov.md/content/transparen%C8%9B)
 PISA includes 2015 and 2018.




&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

The target was achieved.&nbsp;The procurement was completed; the equipment and learning materials were provided to 100 schools.&nbsp;

